# Experiment H (wall tag, forward camera; METHODOLOGY "Experiment H: pre-registration"). Appended after the standard chain.
# ONE source set: tag position + yaw (ExternalNav) with optical-flow velocity and rangefinder height (no switching, ruling R2).
VISO_TYPE 1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 5
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 2
EK3_SRC1_YAW 6
VISO_POS_M_NSE 0.02    # = S0a sigma_pos (p95 horizontal error of valid detections at 1.5 m: 18 mm, rounded up)
VISO_YAW_M_NSE 0.05    # effective yaw sigma = EKF3's 5 deg floor
VISO_QUAL_MIN 0
VISO_DELAY_MS 31       # S0b (H_s0b): min receipt 31.2 ms, node 31.0 ms (agree within 5 ms); D2/D20 rule; <= 60 ms horizon
ARMING_SKIPCHK 262144  # skip only check bit 18 (VisualOdometry)
# Controller start state pinned (ruling 2026-10-08 item 4): every H flight, in both ArduPilot trees and for every flying
# estimator, starts from the same learned hover throttle. 0.310 = the value the earlier H flights converged to and started
# from (H_s1_r1 learned 0.293 -> 0.310; H_s1_r3, H_gt_fgo, H_gt_ukf start at 0.3102-0.3103; corridor/T/O flights with the
# same airframe sit at 0.293). It had been supplied by each tree's eeprom, which differed once the port tree's was cleared.
MOT_THST_HOVER 0.310
MOT_HOVER_LEARN 1      # learn in flight as before (2), but do not SAVE, so the pinned start value persists between flights
